### Posts - Open uploaded post photo
GET {{baseUrl}}{{requestPostPhotoUrl}}

### Posts - Detail request post after photo upload
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestPostId}}

### Posts - Delete request photo as user B should return 403
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestPostId}}/photos/{{requestPhotoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userBAccessToken}}

### Posts - Delete uploaded request photo as owner
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestPostId}}/photos/{{requestPhotoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}

### Posts - Detail request post after photo deletion
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestPostId}}

### Posts - Delete request post as owner
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestPostId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}

### Posts - Deleted request post should return 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestPostId}}

### Posts - Public list after delete
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts

### Posts - Own posts after delete
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}

### Posts - Create lifecycle request post
# @name createRequestLifecyclePost
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "title": "Need help moving furniture",
  "description": "I need help moving furniture upstairs.",
  "postType": "SERVICE_REQUEST",
  "category": "Moving",
  "latitude": 41.9991,
  "longitude": 21.4264,
  "addressLabel": "Karposh, Skopje",
  "contactPhone": "+38970999999",
  "contactEmail": "{{userAEmail}}"
}

> {%
client.global.set("requestLifecyclePostId", response.body.id);
%}

### Posts - Update lifecycle request status to SERVICE_ACCEPTED
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestLifecyclePostId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "SERVICE_ACCEPTED"
}

### Posts - Update lifecycle request status to SERVICE_DONE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestLifecyclePostId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "SERVICE_DONE"
}

### Posts - Invalid request status transition should return 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{requestLifecyclePostId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "REQUESTING"
}

### Posts - Update offer status to UNAVAILABLE
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{offerPostId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "UNAVAILABLE"
}

### Posts - Update offer status back to OFFERING
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{offerPostId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "OFFERING"
}

### Auth - Logout user A
# @name logoutUserA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
Cookie: {{userARefreshCookie}}

> {%
client.global.set("userARevokedRefreshCookie", client.global.get("userARefreshCookie"));
client.global.clear("userARefreshCookie");
%}

### Auth - Refresh after logout should return 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh
Cookie: {{userARevokedRefreshCookie}}

### Posts - Close offer
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{offerPostId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

### Posts - Invalid offer status transition should return 409
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{offerPostId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{userAAccessToken}}
Content-Type: {{json}}

{
  "status": "OFFERING"
}
